                new("Connect a data source", "#data-sources"),
            ]),
        new("api-keys",
            "How do I generate and rotate API keys?",
            "Generate API keys from Settings → API → New key. Each key is scoped to a workspace and a permission set. Rotate by creating a new key, updating your integrations, then revoking the old one. We recommend rotating quarterly.",
